  "_comment": [
    "Per-place fields that neither source can carry, keyed by place name. The name is already",
    "the guide's primary key: GUIDE_DISTANCES is keyed by it and build-guide.mjs refuses to",
    "write a guide where two places share one.",
    "",
    "Here rather than in a column because the sheet has these columns for no place and is spent",
    "input (CLAUDE.md R11), while scripts/guide-extra.csv keeps the sheet's own column shape. One",
    "file holds every addition, so the answer to what a place carries is in one place whichever",
    "source the place itself came from.",
    "",
    "`tags` must all be in src/lib/guide-vocabulary.json, `website` is the business's own page",
    "and never a directory listing of it, and every name here must match a place in the built",
    "guide or the build fails. A rename that silently dropped a place's tags is the failure that",
    "last check exists to prevent.",
    "",
    "Sparse is normal. Roughly a third of the guide is tagged and a seventh has a website; a",
    "field here is a claim someone checked, not a box to fill."
  ],
